      "scope": "Grade 6–8; Hero container (20–45 words)",
      "blueprint": true,
      "blueprintProse": "The Value Proposition Matrix serves as the cognitive anchor for landing page hero sections and product headers. It breaks down into three key elements: a target identifier defining the specific user segment (20%), a clear statement of the operational friction endured (35%), and an explanation of the differentiated mechanism providing relief (45%). \nThis matrix operates via cognitive ease and self-categorization theory. Online users scan digital interfaces within milliseconds; explicitly stating the target audience and operational mechanism allows evaluators to immediately recognize relevance and proceed through the conversion funnel.",
